    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Title">Welcome to LiveCaptions Translator!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_BasedOn">LiveCaptions Translator is based on Windows LiveCaptions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Intro">Before your first running, you need to configure it according to the following steps:&#x0A;</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Step1">&#x0A;1. Open Windows LiveCaptions and follow the guide to download the necessary files for on-device speech recognition and language packs.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Step2">&#x0A;2. Click the</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Gear">⚙️ gear</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Step2b">icon in Windows LiveCaptions to open the settings menu, and select</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Position">&quot;Position &gt; Overlaid on screen&quot;</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Step3">.&#x0A;3. Click the</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Step3b">button located in the setting page of LiveCaptions Translator to hide Windows LiveCaptions.&#x0A;</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_AutoNav">&#x0A;The program has automatically navigated to the setting page and opened Windows LiveCaptions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_ShowHint">, please [Show] LiveCaptions on the setting page and do it in Windows LiveCaptions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_ToChange">To change the</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Tip">&#x0A;&#x0A;Tip:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Wiki">&#x0A;For more details, visit our wiki: </sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Welcome_Done">After completing the configuration, you can switch back to the main page and enjoy real-time audio translation.&#x0A;</sys:String>
